{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Out Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy experimenting with 70+ cards and 20+ passive items in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Beans of Production to your Wishlist and be the first to know about updates and official releases. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord channel too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your barista skills to smash daily goals and stave off the thirsty masses in this rogue-lite match-3 deckbuilder. Play your cards right to clear ingredients, beat increasingly demanding quotas, unlock passives, and make it through the work week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944280/extras/36eb4b44308da095f1b63d1bbf371b45.poster.avif?t=1731006651\" width=620 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944280/extras/36eb4b44308da095f1b63d1bbf371b45.webm?t=1731006651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944280/extras/24a72db813e09315d0687425586cf4fd.poster.avif?t=1731006651\" width=620 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944280/extras/24a72db813e09315d0687425586cf4fd.webm?t=1731006651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944280/extras/24a72db813e09315d0687425586cf4fd.mp4?t=1731006651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards as you make your way home eac